			"Even though several cards come from Starter Deck 21, Sabo has the edge in this matchup.",
			"Get your engine online quickly.",
			"Keep adding characters so the pressure never lets up.",
		],
	},
	{
		label: "Favorable",
		tone: "up",
		icon: "^",
		leader: yamato16,
		notes: [
			"Yamato is one of Sabo's best matchups.",
			"Follow your usual game plan.",
			"Try to establish your board quickly through the main combo.",
		],
	},
	{
		label: "Slightly Unfavorable",
		tone: "down",
		icon: "v",
		leader: teach16,
		notes: [
			"Sabo mostly wants to keep the pressure up while developing multiple characters over several turns so Teach has to keep answering the board.",
			"Keep building your board instead of looking for one all-in explosive turn.",
			"Use the leader effect to preserve key characters when you need to.",
		],
	},
	{
		label: "Even",
		tone: "even",
		icon: "=",
		leader: kuzan12,
		notes: [
			"Stick to your standard game plan.",
			"Develop your board gradually and keep your sequencing clean.",
		],
	},
	{
		label: "Even",
		tone: "even",
		icon: "=",
		leader: nami11,
		notes: [
			"Keep building your engine without changing your curve.",
			"Try to leave multiple threats on the board at once.",
			"Many of Nami's characters have On K.O. effects, so focus Life and force the opponent to spend resources there.",
		],
	},
	{
		label: "Even",
		tone: "even",
		icon: "=",
		leader: kid10,
		notes: [
			"Assemble your main combo quickly.",
			"Keep developing your board throughout the game.",
		],
	},
	{
		label: "Unfavorable",
		tone: "down",
		icon: "v",
		leader: rosinante12,
		notes: [
			"Follow your normal game plan.",
			"Keep developing characters through Sanji and Pirates Docking Six.",
			"Rosinante's plan is simply more stable over a long game, and that's the real problem here.",
		],
	},
	{
		label: "Unfavorable",
		tone: "down",
		icon: "v",
		leader: rgLuffy13,
		notes: [
			"Don't fall behind on board in the first few turns.",
			"Develop your combo as soon as possible so the pressure stays constant.",
		],
	},
	{
		label: "Unfavorable",
		tone: "down",
		icon: "v",
		leader: enel15,
		notes: [
			"Purple Enel is one of Sabo's worst matchups.",
			"Keep following your curve instead of trying to reinvent the plan.",
			"Do your best to maintain multiple threats at the same time.",
		],
	},
	{
		label: "Slightly Favorable",
		tone: "up",
		icon: "^",
		leader: ace15,
		notes: [
			"Develop your board as quickly as possible.",
			"Hold your resources so the pressure never really stops.",
		],
	},
	{
		label: "Unfavorable",
		tone: "down",
		icon: "v",
		leader: boa14,
		notes: [
			"Keep following your main game plan.",
			"Try to keep multiple characters on the board at all times.",
		],
